# The repository root .gitignore excludes *.log and *.csv globally (lines 7-8) and the directory
# name `generated` (line 73). This stage's evidence *is* logs and CSVs — test-suite logs, watcher
# logs, and the signpost-filtered tt-perf-report CSVs the perf summary is derived from — so
# re-include them under doc/. Without this they are silently absent from the commit and the
# evidence is only reproducible from a live worktree.
!generated/
!*.log
!*.csv

# Side-output of TT_METAL_LOGS_PATH, not stage evidence: the inspector dumps kernel/program/mesh
# state for every run (3 MB uncompressed, regenerated by any run). The watcher log next to it is
# the evidence, and it is committed. Excluding this keeps the pre-commit 500 KB rule satisfiable
# without hand-gzipping files the runner does not produce.
functional_decoder/watcher/generated/inspector/

# Rows from filtered (`-k` / `-m`) test sessions. Real evidence comes from whole-file runs; these
# exist so a subset run cannot overwrite it. See tests/harness.py reset_log.
functional_decoder/*_partial.jsonl
